    subtopic: 'Letter And Essay',
    summary_60s: 'Writing is super important for English. It helps you share your thoughts clearly and get your point across in different situations. In this note, we will explore five key writing tasks that are essential for JSS3 students: Informal Letter,. Formal Letter,. Semi-Formal Letter,. De',
