    subtopic: 'Question Tags',
    summary_60s: 'Question tags are small questions attached to the end of statements, separated by a comma. They turn regular statements into questions that invite a response. Example: Statement: "Chioma is coming to school today.". With question tag: "Chioma is coming to school today, isn\'t she?',
